<title>UK: Warner Est. to buy Merivale shares in JVs.</title>
<headline>Warner Est. to buy Merivale shares in JVs.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Warner Estate Holdings Plc, the diversified UK property investor, said on Monday that it has agreed with Merivale Moore Plc to terminate their joint ventures and buy Merivale's shares in each joint venture.</p>
</text>
